  2. Tall                         │ +--------------------------------------------------+ │
                                  │ |  Wide layout                                     | │
                                  │ |                                                  | │
                                  │ |  Content runs across the full width, with        | │
                                  │ |  generous gutters between columns and roomy      | │
                                  │ |  margins on both sides. Line length stays        | │
                                  │ |  moderate so the eye can return to the start     | │
                                  │ |  of each line easily, and extra whitespace       | │
                                  │ |  between sections separates ideas clearly.       | │
                                  │ |                                                  | │
                                  │ |  [ Column A ]      [ Column B ]      [ Column C ]| │
                                  │ |                                                  | │
                                  │ |  Best for: wide monitors, side-by-side reading,  | │
                                  │ |  and scanning many items at once.                | │
